    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SALLY: Yeah. Till next week. So I guess they're okay.\nIRENE: I’m sure they are. You just be strong for them, dear.",
      "AMANDA: Oh, God, close the door!\nMRS. CARMODY: Now do you see? Now do you believe?",
      "AMANDA: Oh, God...\nMRS. CARMODY: \"And there came out of the smoke locusts upon the earth, and unto them was given power, as the scorpions of the earth have power.\" Wow. Look…\nAMANDA: The light. I think they're attracted to the light.",
      "AMANDA: Shut up, you miserable old buzzard.\nMRS. CARMODY: Harlot! Whore! She serves the Foul One! She serves Satan!\nAMANDA: Bullshit. Stoning people who piss you off is perfectly okay. Says so in the Bible.\nAMANDA: And I got lots of peas."
    ]
